==Battleground==
*1 [[M. Bison (Enemy)|M. Bison]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Ryu (Enemy)|Ryu]] spawns after 47.33 seconds<sup>1,420f</sup>.
*1 [[Ken (Enemy)|Ken]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 8.33 seconds<sup>250f</sup>, delay 31.67~33.33 seconds<sup>950f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 11.67 seconds<sup>350f</sup>, delay 31.67~33.33 seconds<sup>950f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 40~50 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Your goal is to eliminate M. Bison before Ryu and Ken show up to wreck your day, since its easier to stall them when M. Bison isn't attacking your front lines. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] does a great job at this, but you need to have good timing. Preferably, You will want Awakened Bahamut to stay alive and handle Ryu and Ken, however this isn't necessary. Stall both of them long enough to get a second Awakened Bahamut on the field to clear the stage.

